# NeuroLingua CAT12 Structural Outputs
===============================

This folder contains CAT12-processed structural MRI outputs for the participants in the dataset. Outputs include volume-based and surface-based regional measures, quality metrics, and other metadata.

Dataset Structure
-----------------
- `sub-XXXX/` contains individual subject results:
  - `mri/` - segmented tissue maps
  - `label/` - ROI labels
  - `surf/` - cortical surface data
  - `report/` - quality and processing reports
- `SummaryStatistics/` contains CSV files with regional volumetric measures (GM, WM, CSF).

Summary Statistics by Atlas / Measure
-----------------
Voxel-based morphometry (VBM)

Neuromorphometrics atlas: GM, WM, CSF volumes (ROI_VBM_n1018_neuromorphometrics_*.csv)

Mori atlas: GM, WM volumes (ROI_VBM_n1018_mori_*.csv)

LPBA40 atlas: GM, WM volumes (ROI_VBM_n1018_lpba40_*.csv)

AAL3 atlas: GM volumes (ROI_VBM_n1018_aal3_Vgm.csv)

Anatomy3 atlas: GM, WM volumes (ROI_VBM_n1018_anatomy3_*.csv)

COBRA atlas: GM, WM volumes (ROI_VBM_n1018_cobra_*.csv)

IBSR atlas: GM, WM, CSF volumes (ROI_VBM_n1018_ibsr_*.csv)

JulichBrain atlas: GM, WM volumes (ROI_VBM_n1018_julichbrain_*.csv)

Schaefer2018 parcellations: 100, 200, 400, 600 parcels; GM, WM volumes (ROI_VBM_n1018_Schaefer2018_*_Vgm/Vwm.csv)

SUIT atlas: GM, WM volumes (ROI_VBM_n1018_suit_*.csv)

Thalamus / Tian subcortex: GM volumes (ROI_VBM_n1018_thalamic_nuclei_Vgm.csv, ROI_VBM_n1018_Tian_Subcortex_S4_7T_Vgm.csv)

Surface-based morphometry (SBM)
-----------------
Desikan-Killiany (DK40) atlas: cortical thickness (ROI_SBM_n1018_aparc_DK40_thickness.csv)

Destrieux / aparc-a2009s atlas: cortical thickness (ROI_SBM_n1018_aparc_a2009s_thickness.csv)

HCP-MMP1 atlas: cortical thickness (ROI_SBM_n1018_aparc_HCP_MMP1_thickness.csv)

Schaefer2018 parcellations: 100, 200, 400, 600 parcels; cortical thickness (ROI_SBM_n1018_Schaefer2018_*_thickness.csv)

Quality and Metadata
-----------------
ForBrainchart.csv / .txt – metadata for BrainChart pipeline

IQR.txt / logs – quality control logs

Quality_measures_wmp1.csv – global measures (e.g., TIV, mean GM/WM)

TIV.txt – total intracranial volume


Notes
-----
Filenames follow BIDS derivative conventions where possible, but some may retain original SPM-specific naming conventions.

Participants included in this derivative correspond to those present in participants.tsv.

## Citation
-----
Please cite the CAT12 toolbox (https://www.neuro.uni-jena.de/cat/) and the original NeuroLingua dataset when using these data

